Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.40,0:00:43.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了 少年
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.18,0:00:47.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看你茫然得好像仍身臨夢境一般
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.27,0:00:53.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我好像又突然睡了一陣子
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.31,0:00:58.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感覺如何
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.64,0:01:01.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別擔心 這是常有的事啦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.12,0:01:07.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我覺得會束緊身體的衣物還是脫了的好 就幫你脫了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.46,0:01:11.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你還出了冷汗 所以也順便幫你擦乾了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.47,0:01:15.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一直…在旁邊看護我嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.80,0:01:19.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不必擔心 我沒做任何不正經的事
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.56,0:01:22.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還是說
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.67,0:01:27.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,少年你其實很希望大姐姐做出不正經的事嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.82,0:01:30.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這種事呀 那種事
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.11,0:01:31.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不…不是啦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.41,0:01:34.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是想到 被你看到我的糗樣…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.27,0:01:38.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你完全不必感到羞恥
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.38,0:01:41.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在此好好調理一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.26,0:01:43.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.84,0:03:23.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是我從小就患上的老病
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.56,0:03:27.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對於其病因 你有頭緒嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.33,0:03:30.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是很清楚…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.70,0:03:36.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過由於何時都可能突然睡過去 有時會覺得不安
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.00,0:03:41.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,從以前起 只有和大家在一起的時候我才最能放心
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.75,0:03:47.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他們就是我的歸宿
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.70,0:03:52.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Little Busters對我來說也是唯一安閒舒適的集體
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.78,0:03:56.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也沒想到 曾不屑於活在任何集體裡的自己
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.53,0:03:58.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在卻能像這樣被伙伴們包圍
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.33,0:04:02.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在能永遠持續下去就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.20,0:04:05.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在…永遠?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.86,0:04:07.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為實在是太快樂了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.60,0:04:10.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我希望現在永遠不要改變
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.93,0:04:15.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,確實 發生了不少事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.74,0:04:19.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,試膽大會 初次棒球賽 烤餅派對
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.88,0:04:20.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.89,0:04:24.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來谷同學加入後 也一直…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.07,0:04:31.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恭介是從五月中旬開始打棒球的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.00,0:04:33.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,6月20日
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.67,0:04:37.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原來來谷同學才加入一個月啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.69,0:04:41.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,總覺得已經過了很久
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.97,0:04:46.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.82,0:04:54.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我感覺我們進行過…同樣的對話
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.13,0:04:56.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就在這間廣播室裡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.58,0:05:00.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你…和我?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.49,0:05:02.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.83,0:05:06.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那時也下著雨
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.17,0:05:13.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不說這個 談談你對現狀的想法吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.42,0:05:17.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你現在可是和可愛的女同學共處一室哦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.25,0:05:19.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你…你這麼一說倒是的確如此…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.00,0:05:21.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不會小鹿亂撞嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.64,0:05:23.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不如說你的小鹿已經在亂撞了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.64,0:05:27.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還不快說「呀嚯 小鹿撞得我胸前一酥」
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.98,0:05:32.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還有「哈…哈…真心讚啊 嘿嘿嘿 不能再讚」
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.18,0:05:33.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不會說的啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.29,0:05:38.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剛才我可是有給你陪睡 幫你暖身的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.60,0:05:39.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.04,0:05:42.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,理樹君就是可愛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.90,0:05:47.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欣賞你慌神時的一舉一動是大姐姐我最大的娛樂
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.75,0:05:51.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幹嘛總這樣調戲我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.18,0:05:55.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為我喜歡理樹君呀
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.30,0:06:01.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 我出這張
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.10,0:06:02.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如何
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.10,0:06:06.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 理樹 到你了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.28,0:06:09.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 理樹
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.68,0:06:11.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,理樹
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.54,0:06:14.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,搞什麼 發什麼呆呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.19,0:06:16.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你碰上什麼好事了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.16,0:06:19.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,從剛才起就一幅心不在焉的樣子
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.05,0:06:22.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒…沒什麼啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.57,0:06:24.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 絕對有貓膩
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.61,0:06:25.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,確實
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.65,0:06:30.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他從來谷的護理下歸來後就一直有些坐立不安
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.19,0:06:32.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喔 得到來谷的護理了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.33,0:06:35.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為我又因為那個突然睡過去了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.80,0:06:37.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒什麼大礙吧 理樹
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.43,0:06:39.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,換言之 戀愛了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.47,0:06:42.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,戀愛?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.24,0:06:44.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,戀愛…是指…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.88,0:06:45.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 那個
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.16,0:06:47.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鈴你居然懂這個?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.63,0:06:48.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是說…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.70,0:06:52.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呃 理樹 你愛上那個來谷了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.43,0:06:54.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是啦 你說什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.43,0:06:57.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原來如此 你正在悸動對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.24,0:07:00.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別這樣 謙吾 你的表情和台詞對不上號啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.34,0:07:03.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這就對了 理樹 我一直有個念頭
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.19,0:07:06.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「你應該談次戀愛」
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.80,0:07:10.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,苦於戀愛 傷於情場都會使人成長
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.02,0:07:14.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,戀愛會將理樹塑造為一個真男人!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.78,0:07:16.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別誤會了 我…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.59,0:07:18.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那 你到底喜歡誰
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.78,0:07:24.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真心喜歡過誰嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.13,0:07:33.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,話說 那恭介你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.53,0:07:34.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我明白了 理樹
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.05,0:07:36.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,答不上來也就意味著…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.02,0:07:39.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,理樹喜歡的果然是恭介嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.60,0:07:41.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果真如此的話我會很開心
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.26,0:07:42.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是什麼邏輯嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.90,0:07:45.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼是恭介啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.03,0:07:48.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我怎麼辦啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.67,0:07:51.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也喜歡理樹的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.11,0:07:55.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別誤會 理樹喜歡的是來谷
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.83,0:07:58.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是吧 理樹 為什麼要愛上那麼恐怖的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.69,0:08:01.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,從實招來吧 你到底看上來谷的哪一點了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.44,0:08:03.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,戀愛是沒有理由的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.63,0:08:06.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為戀愛就是如此
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.11,0:08:07.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等…別妄下定論啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.41,0:08:08.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 我拒絕
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.65,0:08:11.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你現在不該轉向被動 要一口氣推到底
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.98,0:08:10.51,Comment,NTP,0,0,0,,理樹 我到底缺少了什麼…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.61,0:08:13.32,Comment,NTP,0,0,0,,你到底對她的哪一點心動了…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.42,0:08:14.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我先回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.40,0:08:17.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 大富豪還沒玩完啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.33,0:08:19.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不玩了 我要回去
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.01,0:08:27.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這算什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.80,0:08:30.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,少女心 海底針
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.97,0:08:36.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,總之我們就全面支援理樹的戀情吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.30,0:08:38.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,作戰名為
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.40,0:08:41.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Operation:Little Love Love Hunters
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.00,0:08:42.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Litte
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.87,0:08:43.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Love Love
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.94,0:08:45.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Hunters?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.90,0:08:51.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感覺好怪
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.43,0:08:53.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.44,0:08:56.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,作戰名為 Loli Loli Hunters
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.16,0:09:00.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剛才的冷場是鬧哪樣
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.06,0:09:03.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這不代表我是蘿莉控啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.20,0:09:07.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那咱們先把這個問題放一邊去
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.43,0:09:09.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放個頭啊 這可是最重要問題
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.03,0:09:11.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是偶爾瞟到了這本漫畫而已
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.47,0:09:14.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這有什麼 不就是蘿莉控嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.78,0:09:16.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我完全不介意的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.35,0:09:19.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,閉嘴 女僕控
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.60,0:09:20.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.35,0:09:24.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你剛才盯著女僕不放 我可是看得一清二楚
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.14,0:09:26.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才才才沒有 碰巧而已
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.71,0:09:29.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還有謙吾 你是巫女控
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.30,0:09:31.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哼…哼 荒唐
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.20,0:09:33.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你剛才動搖了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.64,0:09:34.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才沒有!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.65,0:09:35.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,給你拿去看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.64,0:09:37.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看這邊 看啊看啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.65,0:09:39.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈哈 看啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.82,0:09:40.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,慢著!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.62,0:09:41.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我突然發現
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.03,0:09:44.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(21)這樣寫的話…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.93,0:09:46.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看起來超像蘿莉啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.93,0:09:46.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs21}※(21)ロリ(蘿莉)
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.63,0:09:48.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼可能
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.64,0:09:49.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.10,0:09:52.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,確…確實有點像
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.96,0:09:55.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇啊 越看越像了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.74,0:09:59.23,Comment,NTP,0,0,0,,這麼說…我也是蘿莉控!?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.90,0:09:59.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這下我要是到了21歲 寫真人(21)的時候
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.58,0:10:01.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就會變成真人蘿莉了…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.75,0:10:08.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不想長到21歲啊啊啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.41,0:10:19.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.92,0:10:21.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底哪裡有因果關係了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.52,0:10:24.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先告白 我制定了作戰計劃
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.82,0:10:27.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走 一起去放煙火吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.70,0:10:31.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是一尺彈
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.86,0:10:33.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真貨嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.06,0:10:36.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我以前出外旅行時別人送我的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.74,0:10:40.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,當時沒錢吃飯 就給造煙火的打過下手
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.90,0:10:43.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們要放的就是這個
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.00,0:10:46.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我還是沒理解
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.54,0:10:50.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是說 要先把理樹和來谷弄進夜間的校舍裡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.29,0:10:54.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然後由我們 用這顆煙火彈營造氣氛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.18,0:10:57.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,彩飾夜空的大朵煙火
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.14,0:11:00.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,戀心升華 不在話下
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.23,0:11:10.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,煙火散盡後 靜謐之中兩人互相耳語
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.94,0:11:12.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,愛!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.56,0:11:13.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,愛!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.17,0:11:14.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是愛!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.34,0:11:19.93,Comment,NTP,0,0,0,,愛…!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.06,0:11:18.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好白痴
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.65,0:11:19.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一團亂了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.46,0:11:26.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,愛…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.36,0:11:30.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不愧是人稱浪漫總統的謙吾 還是你明白
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.46,0:11:33.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呃…這稱號我還是第一次聽說
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.16,0:11:35.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,機會只有一次
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.85,0:11:36.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也讓鈴 神北
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.24,0:11:39.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能美 三枝 西園
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.83,0:11:41.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欣賞一下大朵煙火吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.51,0:11:42.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讓大家看?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.90,0:11:46.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對啊 我們還沒回烤餅派對的禮呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.80,0:11:48.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用煙火作回禮蠻有創意的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.04,0:11:50.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就辦煙火大會囉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.97,0:11:52.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好主意
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.40,0:11:54.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她們一定會很高興的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.19,0:11:56.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 女生都是超愛看煙火的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.21,0:11:58.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,樂意奉陪
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.88,0:11:59.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好嘞
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.02,0:12:01.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我沒意見
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.43,0:12:02.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這事絕對有意思
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.04,0:12:04.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼 開始定計劃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.14,0:12:05.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都湊過來
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.03,0:12:11.99,Comment,NTP,0,0,0,,首先 真人和謙吾 我有事拜託你們
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.19,0:12:11.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,無論怎麼想 這計劃都很傻
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.03,0:12:18.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是認真策劃荒唐的惡作劇時才最讓人興奮
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.74,0:12:23.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們一點都沒變
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.63,0:12:27.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那雨呢 不知道會不會停啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.25,0:12:29.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晚上肯定會停
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.80,0:12:30.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,6月20號
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.13,0:12:32.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,煙火大會今晚召開
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.18,0:12:33.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.13,0:12:42.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好 這天氣還算湊合
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.73,0:12:43.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.66,0:12:46.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們也找來了一堆
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.72,0:12:50.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是沒來得及放的煙火
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.34,0:12:51.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 這麼多啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.70,0:12:56.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說起來在教室裡欣賞煙火可不是隨時做得到的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.57,0:12:59.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過大傢伙要怎麼放呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.33,0:13:00.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放心 包在我身上
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.68,0:13:02.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我跟專業人士學過
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.25,0:13:04.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一點皮毛…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.00,0:13:06.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我現在相當不放心了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.56,0:13:10.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這小子幹什麼都讓人不放心
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.39,0:13:11.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別瞎操心
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.60,0:13:14.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,理樹你負責按計劃把女生們帶往指定地點
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.50,0:13:16.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.23,0:13:20.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,記得創造和來谷獨處的機會 明白沒
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.30,0:13:24.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來 開始做準備
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.20,0:13:31.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要送我們禮物?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.40,0:13:33.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼禮物啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.76,0:13:35.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好興奮的說
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.10,0:13:37.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,暫時保密
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.43,0:13:42.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唷 大姐頭
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.12,0:13:44.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,理樹君
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.27,0:13:48.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,邀美少女們到夜幕之下
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.43,0:13:52.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莫非是想搞些色色的惡作劇?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.30,0:13:54.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不…不是那種事啦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.54,0:13:56.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯…跟我來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.93,0:14:01.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好暗…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.72,0:14:05.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事啦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.23,0:14:10.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恭介 抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.26,0:14:14.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我根本沒打算和來谷同學獨處
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.90,0:14:19.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說來 就是這附近了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.30,0:14:23.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,據說 有無頭亡靈 出沒
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.54,0:14:35.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我正打算補上 這段謠言是三枝同學放出來的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.70,0:14:37.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,結果罪魁禍首也一起跑了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.93,0:14:42.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等…等等 你們等一下啦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.15,0:14:48.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟…糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.75,0:14:50.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,點不著火…這破東西
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.01,0:14:52.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,靠氣勢 用氣勢點著它
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.88,0:14:53.54,Comment,NTP,0,0,0,,這該怎麼辦啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.37,0:15:03.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都跑哪裡去了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.27,0:15:09.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,煙火就要升空了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.33,0:15:16.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雨…停了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.99,0:15:29.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恭介…果然厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.24,0:15:36.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,理樹君吃驚的樣子還是這麼有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.02,0:15:38.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來…來谷同學
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.69,0:15:40.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呀嚯～
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.36,0:15:46.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,耶 拿這些當火種吧 耶耶
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.19,0:15:48.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.37,0:15:49.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.74,0:15:51.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好耶 終於點著了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.83,0:15:53.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,衝啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.56,0:15:59.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是煙火
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.03,0:16:03.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 好漂亮的說
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.80,0:16:05.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好漂亮 好漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.32,0:16:06.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好美
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.31,0:16:17.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原來如此
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.92,0:16:20.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是想讓我們看這個啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.67,0:16:27.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,傻瓜們的腦子裡也有如此創新的點子呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.03,0:16:30.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呀嚯～
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.38,0:16:30.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.20,0:16:33.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,該上壓箱貨了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.51,0:16:36.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喔 走起
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.73,0:16:39.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,衝啊衝啊 上去囉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.40,0:16:48.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,煙火最讚～
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.48,0:16:48.34,Comment,NTP,0,0,0,,耶 好讚～
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.26,0:17:17.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這可真是厲害啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.90,0:17:21.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Little Busters
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.26,0:17:26.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做得出這種最棒傻事的伙伴 可不常見
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.77,0:17:28.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.27,0:17:42.21,Comment,NTP,0,0,0,,{\3c&H1F1F1F&\bord1\an7\fs21}告白了嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.54,0:17:49.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告白?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.93,0:18:00.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恭介問了我
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.77,0:18:06.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「你真心喜歡過誰嗎」
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.69,0:18:12.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,結果呢 你有嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.72,0:18:22.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我擠不出隻言片語
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.38,0:18:27.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是看她看得入迷
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.93,0:18:33.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為這麼美的來谷同學
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.90,0:18:37.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我還是第一次見
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.51,0:18:59.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.55,0:19:04.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我這是…怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.91,0:19:29.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我到底…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.17,0:19:36.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喜歡…誰呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.53,0:19:55.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吶 今天不是20號而是21號吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.00,0:19:56.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.02,0:19:59.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這電子錶壞了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.20,0:20:01.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 今天就是20號
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.67,0:20:03.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,20號是昨天
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.94,0:20:05.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恭介昨晚不是也說了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.16,0:20:10.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「6月20號今晚 煙火大會召開」
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.70,0:20:17.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你做夢了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.50,0:20:23.73,Comment,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 慘了慘了 抱歉抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.63,0:20:23.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 我的…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.77,0:20:26.28,Comment,NTP,0,0,0,,真心抱歉 理樹
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.53,0:20:28.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這水漬不是昨天就有了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.73,0:20:30.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悲劇了…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.11,0:20:31.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過這雨下得夠久了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.20,0:20:37.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣一直下 明天也練不成棒球了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.48,0:20:38.14,Comment,NTP,0,0,0,,交通情報播報完畢 以下播送天氣預報
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.68,0:20:40.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,6月20號的天氣預報
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.31,0:20:45.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下午6時前的降水率為70%…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.04,0:20:49.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這些都是昨天發生過的…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.03,0:21:10.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我昨天也見過這個光景
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.33,0:21:16.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.57,0:21:44.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了 少年
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.04,0:21:51.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看你茫然得 好像仍身臨夢境一般
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.49,0:22:07.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,600)\pos(740,350)\bord0\1c&HFFFFFF&\fsp15}第2話
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.49,0:22:07.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,600)\an6\pos(818,380)\bord0\1c&HFFFFFF&\fsp15}彼時雨亦落
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.70,0:23:35.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你會忘掉那漸漸消融的白雪嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.10,0:23:36.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下集
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.19,0:23:39.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想永遠留在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,OP
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.69,0:02:03.44,OP1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}一人じゃさみしい
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.13,0:02:09.75,OP1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}だから手を繋いだんだっけ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.65,0:02:20.73,OP1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}それじゃいつまでも 子供のままだ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.95,0:02:28.46,OP1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}どうしても伝えたかったんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.02,0:02:34.53,OP1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}繋いだ手はもう
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.18,0:02:41.11,OP1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}バラバラになる
